msgid "Execute the following commands to meet the requirements:"
msgstr "执行以下命令以满足这些要求："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:473
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc ifconfig_em0_ipv6=\"inet6 2001:db8:4672:6565:2026:5043:2d42:5344 prefixlen 64\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc ifconfig_em0_ipv6=\"inet6 2001:db8:4672:6565:2026:5043:2d42:5344 prefixlen 64\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:476
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To assign a default router, specify its address executing the following "
"command:"
msgstr "要指定默认路由器，请执行以下命令并指定其地址："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:480
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc ipv6_defaultrouter=\"2001:db8:4672:6565::1\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc ipv6_defaultrouter=\"2001:db8:4672:6565::1\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:483
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To configure an additional IPv6 anycast address, specify the anycast address "
"as an `_aliasN`, as specified in man:rc.conf[5], followed by the `anycast` "
"option:"
msgstr "要配置额外的 IPv6 任播地址，请按照 man:rc.conf[5] 中的说明，将任播地址指定为 `_aliasN`，然后添加 `anycast` 选项："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:486
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc ifconfig_em0_alias0=\"inet6 2001:db8:4672:6565::a anycast\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc ifconfig_em0_alias0=\"inet6 2001:db8:4672:6565::a anycast\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:489
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that the applications can't bind to anycast addresses; in that "
"case you need to use an alias address instead."
msgstr "请注意，应用程序无法绑定到任播地址；这种情况下需要改用别名地址。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:491
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Configuring Dynamic IPv6 Address"
msgstr "配置动态 IPv6 地址"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:494
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To dynamically configure the IPv6 address of the interface using crossref:"
"glossary[slaac-glossary,SLAAC], execute the following commands:"
msgstr "要使用 crossref:glossary[slaac-glossary,SLAAC] 动态配置接口的 IPv6 地址，请执行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:499
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# sysrc ifconfig_em0_ipv6=\"inet6 accept_rtadv\"\n"
"# sysrc rtsold_enable=\"YES\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc ifconfig_em0_ipv6=\"inet6 accept_rtadv\"\n# sysrc rtsold_enable=\"YES\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:502
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Note that when IPv6 packet forwarding is enabled (i.e., "
"`ipv6_gateway_enable=YES`), the system will not configure a SLAAC address "
"unless the `net.inet6.ip6.rfc6204w3` man:sysctl[8] variable is set to 1."
msgstr "请注意，启用 IPv6 数据包转发时（即 `ipv6_gateway_enable=YES`），除非将 man:sysctl[8] 变量 `net.inet6.ip6.rfc6204w3` 设置为 1，否则系统不会配置 SLAAC 地址。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:503
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Router Advertisement and Host Auto Configuration"
msgstr "路由器通告和主机自动配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:506
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This section demonstrates how to setup man:rtadvd[8] on an IPv6 router to "
"advertise the IPv6 network prefix and default route."
msgstr "本节演示如何在 IPv6 路由器上设置 man:rtadvd[8]，以通告 IPv6 网络前缀和默认路由。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:508
#, fuzzy
msgid "To enable man:rtadvd[8], execute the following command:"
msgstr "要启用 man:rtadvd[8]，请执行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:512
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc rtadvd_enable=\"YES\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc rtadvd_enable=\"YES\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:516
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It is important to specify the interface on which to do IPv6 router "
"advertisement.  For example, to tell man:rtadvd[8] to use `em0`:"
msgstr "务必指定用于发送 IPv6 路由器通告的接口。例如，要让 man:rtadvd[8] 使用 `em0`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:520
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc rtadvd_interfaces=\"em0\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc rtadvd_interfaces=\"em0\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:523
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Next, create the configuration file, [.filename]#/etc/rtadvd.conf# as seen "
"in this example:"
msgstr "接下来，创建配置文件 [.filename]#/etc/rtadvd.conf#，如下例所示："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:528
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"em0:\\\n"
"\t:addrs#1:addr=\"2001:db8:1f11:246::\":prefixlen#64:tc=ether:\n"
msgstr "em0:\\\n\t:addrs#1:addr=\"2001:db8:1f11:246::\":prefixlen#64:tc=ether:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:531
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Replace `em0` with the interface to be used and `2001:db8:1f11:246::` with "
"the prefix of the allocation."
msgstr "将 `em0` 替换为要使用的接口，并将 `2001:db8:1f11:246::` 替换为分配到的前缀。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:534
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For a dedicated `/64` subnet, nothing else needs to be changed.  Otherwise, "
"change the `prefixlen#` to the correct value."
msgstr "对于专用的 `/64` 子网，无需更改其他内容。否则，请将 `prefixlen#` 改为正确的值。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:535
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "IPv6 and IPv4 Address mapping"
msgstr "IPv6 和 IPv4 地址映射"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:540
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When IPv6 is enabled on a server, there may be a need to enable IPv4 mapped "
"IPv6 address communication.  This compatibility option allows for IPv4 "
"addresses to be represented as IPv6 addresses.  Permitting IPv6 applications "
"to communicate with IPv4 and vice versa may be a security issue."
msgstr "在服务器上启用 IPv6 后，可能需要启用 IPv4 映射的 IPv6 地址通信。此兼容性选项允许将 IPv4 地址表示为 IPv6 地址。允许 IPv6 应用程序与 IPv4 通信，反之亦然，可能会带来安全问题。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:544
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This option may not be required in most cases and is available only for "
"compatibility.  This option will allow IPv6-only applications to work with "
"IPv4 in a dual stack environment.  This is most useful for third party "
"applications which may not support an IPv6-only environment."
msgstr "大多数情况下可能不需要此选项，它仅用于兼容性。此选项可让仅支持 IPv6 的应用程序在双栈环境中使用 IPv4。它对可能不支持纯 IPv6 环境的第三方应用程序最有用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:546
#, fuzzy
msgid "To enable this feature execute the following command:"
msgstr "要启用此功能，请执行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:550
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc ipv6_ipv4mapping=\"YES\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc ipv6_ipv4mapping=\"YES\"\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:553
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Wireless Networks"
msgstr "无线网络"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:556
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Most wireless networks are based on the link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"IEEE_802.11[IEEE(R) 802.11 standards]."
msgstr "大多数无线网络都基于 link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IEEE_802.11[IEEE(R) 802.11 标准]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:558
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"FreeBSD supports networks that operate using link:https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/IEEE_802.11a-1999[802.11a], link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"IEEE_802.11b-1999[802.11b], link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"IEEE_802.11g-2003[802.11g] and link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"IEEE_802.11n-2009[802.11n]."
msgstr "FreeBSD 支持使用 link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IEEE_802.11a-1999[802.11a]、link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IEEE_802.11b-1999[802.11b]、link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IEEE_802.11g-2003[802.11g] 和 link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IEEE_802.11n-2009[802.11n] 运行的网络。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:562
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IEEE_802.11ac-2013[802.11ac] support on "
"FreeBSD is currently under development."
msgstr "FreeBSD 对 link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/IEEE_802.11ac-2013[802.11ac] 的支持目前仍在开发中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:565
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A basic wireless network consists of multiple stations communicating with "
"radios that broadcast in either the 2.4GHz or 5GHz band, though this varies "
"according to the locale and is also changing to enable communication in the "
"2.3GHz and 4.9GHz ranges."
msgstr "基本的无线网络由多个站点组成，这些站点通过无线电通信，信号通常在 2.4GHz 或 5GHz 频段广播；具体频段因地区而异，并且也在变化，以支持在 2.3GHz 和 4.9GHz 范围内通信。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:567
#, fuzzy
msgid "There are three basic steps to configure a wireless network:"
msgstr "配置无线网络主要分为三个步骤："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:569
#, fuzzy
msgid "Scan and select an access point"
msgstr "扫描并选择接入点"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:570
#, fuzzy
msgid "Authenticate the station"
msgstr "对站点进行身份验证"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:571
#, fuzzy
msgid "Configure an IP address or use DHCP."
msgstr "配置 IP 地址或使用 DHCP。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:573
#, fuzzy
msgid "The following sections discuss each step."
msgstr "以下各节将分别讨论这些步骤。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:575
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Quick Start to Connect to a Wireless Network"
msgstr "连接到无线网络的快速入门"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:578
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Connecting FreeBSD to an existing wireless network is a very common "
"situation."
msgstr "将 FreeBSD 连接到现有无线网络是很常见的情况。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:581
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This Quick Start procedure shows the steps required to connect to a network "
"using basic authentication.  A more detailed procedure is given in the next "
"section."
msgstr "本快速入门过程介绍了使用基本身份验证连接到网络所需的步骤。下一节将介绍更详细的过程。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:583
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The first step is to obtain the Service Set Identifier (SSID) and Pre-Shared "
"Key (PSK) for the wireless network from the network administrator."
msgstr "第一步是向网络管理员获取无线网络的服务集标识符（SSID）和预共享密钥（PSK）。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:585
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The second step is to add an entry for this network to [.filename]#/etc/"
"wpa_supplicant.conf#."
msgstr "第二步是将此网络的条目添加到 [.filename]#/etc/wpa_supplicant.conf#。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:588
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the file does not exist, create it.  Consult man:wpa_supplicant.conf[5] "
"for details on formatting entries in this file."
msgstr "如果该文件不存在，请创建它。有关此文件中条目的格式，请参阅 man:wpa_supplicant.conf[5]。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:595
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"ctrl_interface=/var/run/wpa_supplicant\n"
"eapol_version=1\n"
"ap_scan=1\n"
"fast_reauth=1\n"
msgstr "ctrl_interface=/var/run/wpa_supplicant\neapol_version=1\nap_scan=1\nfast_reauth=1\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:600
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"network={\n"
" ssid=\"myssid\" <.>\n"
" psk=\"mypsk\" <.>\n"
"}\n"
msgstr "network={\n ssid=\"myssid\" <.>\n psk=\"mypsk\" <.>\n}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:604
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Is the SSID of the wireless network.  Replace it with the name of the "
"wireless network."
msgstr "这是无线网络的 SSID。请将其替换为无线网络的名称。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:606
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Is the PSK of the wireless network.  Replace it with the password of the "
"wireless network."
msgstr "这是无线网络的 PSK。请将其替换为无线网络的密码。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:610
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The third step is to add the network interface entry to configure the "
"network on startup.  Obtain the network device interface by using the sysctl "
"`net.wlan.devices`.  In the listing below, the output of this sysctl shows "
"the network device interface is \"iwm0\"."
msgstr "第三步是添加网络接口条目，以便在启动时配置网络。使用 sysctl `net.wlan.devices` 获取网络设备接口。以下输出显示，该 sysctl 返回的网络设备接口为 \"iwm0\"。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:614
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysctl net.wlan.devices\n"
msgstr "# sysctl net.wlan.devices\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:621
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "net.wlan.devices: iwm0\n"
msgstr "net.wlan.devices: iwm0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:624
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In the sysrc line that follows, replace \"iwm0\" with the output of the "
"sysctl command if needed."
msgstr "在接下来的 sysrc 命令中，如有需要，请将 \"iwm0\" 替换为 sysctl 命令的输出。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:629
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# sysrc wlans_iwm0=\"wlan0\"\n"
"# sysrc ifconfig_wlan0=\"WPA DHCP\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc wlans_iwm0=\"wlan0\"\n# sysrc ifconfig_wlan0=\"WPA DHCP\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:632
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"And the last step is to restart the `netif` service executing the following "
"command:"
msgstr "最后一步是执行以下命令重启 `netif` 服务："

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:639
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Basic Wireless Configuration"
msgstr "无线网络基本配置"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:644
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This section provides a more detailed example of configuring a wireless "
"network card.  To find out what wireless network cards are in the system "
"check the section crossref:network[config-identify-network-adapter, Identify "
"Network Adapters]."
msgstr "本节提供了配置无线网卡的更详细示例。要了解系统中有哪些无线网卡，请参阅 crossref:network[config-identify-network-adapter, Identify Network Adapters] 一节。"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:648
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# ifconfig wlan0 create wlandev iwm0\n"
msgstr "# ifconfig wlan0 create wlandev iwm0\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:655
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc wlans_iwm0=\"wlan0\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc wlans_iwm0=\"wlan0\"\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:660
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Since the regulatory situation is different in various parts of the world, "
"it is necessary to correctly set the domains that apply to your location to "
"have the correct information about what channels can be used."
msgstr "由于世界各地的无线电监管规定各不相同，必须正确设置适用于所在位置的区域，以便获取可用信道的正确信息。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:663
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The available region definitions can be found in [.filename]#/etc/regdomain."
"xml#.  To set the data at runtime, use `ifconfig`:"
msgstr "可用的区域定义见 [.filename]#/etc/regdomain.xml#。要在运行时设置相关信息，请使用 `ifconfig`："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:667
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# ifconfig wlan0 regdomain etsi2 country AT\n"
msgstr "# ifconfig wlan0 regdomain etsi2 country AT\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:670
#, fuzzy
msgid "To persist the settings, add it to [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf#:"
msgstr "要使这些设置持久生效，请将其添加到 [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf#："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:674
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc create_args_wlan0=\"country AT regdomain etsi2\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc create_args_wlan0=\"country AT regdomain etsi2\"\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:678
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Scan Wireless Networks"
msgstr "扫描无线网络"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:681
#, fuzzy
msgid "Available wireless networks can be scanned using man:ifconfig[8]."
msgstr "可以使用 man:ifconfig[8] 扫描可用的无线网络。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:683
#, fuzzy
msgid "To list the wireless networks execute the following command:"
msgstr "执行以下命令可列出无线网络："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:687
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# ifconfig wlan0 up list scan\n"
msgstr "# ifconfig wlan0 up list scan\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:700
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"SSID/MESH ID                      BSSID              CHAN RATE    S:N     INT CAPS\n"
