#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:703
#, fuzzy
msgid "SSID/MESH ID identifies the name of the network."
msgstr "SSID/MESH ID 标识网络名称。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:704
#, fuzzy
msgid "BSSID identifies the MAC address of the access point."
msgstr "BSSID 标识接入点的 MAC 地址。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:705
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"CAPS field identifies the type of each network and the capabilities of the "
"stations operating there (see the definition of `list scan` in man:"
"ifconfig[8] for more details)."
msgstr "CAPS 字段标识每个网络的类型，以及其中运行的站点所具备的功能（详情请参阅 man:ifconfig[8] 中 `list scan` 的定义）。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:707
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Connection and Authentication to a Wireless Network"
msgstr "连接并验证无线网络"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:712
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once a wireless network has been selected from the list of scanned networks, "
"it is necessary to perform the connection and the authentication.  In the "
"vast majority of wireless networks, authentication is done with a password "
"configured in the router.  Other schemes require cryptographic handshakes to "
"be completed before data traffic can flow, either using pre-shared keys or "
"secrets, or more complex schemes that involve backend services such as "
"RADIUS."
msgstr "从扫描到的网络列表中选择无线网络后，需要进行连接和身份验证。绝大多数无线网络使用路由器中配置的密码进行身份验证。其他方案则要求在传输数据之前完成加密握手，可以使用预共享密钥或机密信息，也可以采用涉及 RADIUS 等后端服务的更复杂方案。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:714
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Authenticate with WPA2/WPA/Personal"
msgstr "使用 WPA2/WPA/Personal 进行身份验证"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:717
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The authentication process in a wireless network is managed by man:"
"wpa_supplicant[8]."
msgstr "无线网络的身份验证过程由 man:wpa_supplicant[8] 管理。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:720
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The man:wpa_supplicant[8] configuration will be made in the [.filename]#/etc/"
"wpa_supplicant.conf# file.  For more information, see man:wpa_supplicant."
"conf[5]."
msgstr "man:wpa_supplicant[8] 的配置写入 [.filename]#/etc/wpa_supplicant.conf# 文件。详情请参阅 man:wpa_supplicant.conf[5]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:722
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once the scanning of the wireless networks has been carried out, a network "
"has been chosen and have the password (PSK), that information will be added "
"to the file [.filename]#/etc/wpa_supplicant.conf# as in the following "
"example:"
msgstr "完成无线网络扫描、选定网络并获得密码（PSK）后，将这些信息添加到 [.filename]#/etc/wpa_supplicant.conf# 文件中，如下例所示："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:730
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"network={\n"
"        scan_ssid=1 <.>\n"
"        ssid=\"FreeBSD\" <.>\n"
"        psk=\"12345678\" <.>\n"
"}\n"
msgstr "network={\n        scan_ssid=1 <.>\n        ssid=\"FreeBSD\" <.>\n        psk=\"12345678\" <.>\n}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:733
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"SSID scan technique. Only need to use this option if the network is hidden."
msgstr "SSID 扫描方式。仅当网络为隐藏网络时才需要使用此选项。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:734
#, fuzzy
msgid "Network name."
msgstr "网络名称。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:735
#, fuzzy
msgid "Password of the wireless network."
msgstr "无线网络的密码。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:737
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The next step will be to configure the wireless connection in the file [."
"filename]#/etc/rc.conf#."
msgstr "下一步是在 [.filename]#/etc/rc.conf# 文件中配置无线连接。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:739
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To use a static address it will be necessary to execute the following "
"command:"
msgstr "要使用静态地址，请执行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:743
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc ifconfig_wlan0=\"inet 192.168.1.20 netmask 255.255.255.0\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc ifconfig_wlan0=\"inet 192.168.1.20 netmask 255.255.255.0\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:746
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To use a dynamic address it will be necessary to execute the following "
"command:"
msgstr "要使用动态地址，请执行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:750
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc ifconfig_wlan0=\"WPA DHCP\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc ifconfig_wlan0=\"WPA DHCP\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:753
#, fuzzy
msgid "Then restart the network executing the following command:"
msgstr "然后执行以下命令重启网络："

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:762
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"More information on how to perform more advanced methods of authentication "
"can be obtained at crossref:advanced-networking[network-advanced-wireless,"
"\"Wireless Advanced Authentication\"]."
msgstr "有关如何使用更高级身份验证方法的更多信息，请参阅 crossref:advanced-networking[network-advanced-wireless,\"Wireless Advanced Authentication\"]。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:765
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Authenticate with Open Networks"
msgstr "对开放网络进行身份验证"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:770
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It is important that the user is *very* careful when connecting to open "
"networks without any kind of authentication."
msgstr "连接到没有任何身份验证机制的开放网络时，用户务必格外小心。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:773
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once the wireless network scan is done and the SSID of the wireless network "
"is selected, execute the following command:"
msgstr "完成无线网络扫描并选定无线网络的 SSID 后，执行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:777
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# ifconfig wlan0 ssid SSID\n"
msgstr "# ifconfig wlan0 ssid SSID\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:780
#, fuzzy
msgid "And then execute man:dhclient[8] to get the address configured:"
msgstr "然后执行 man:dhclient[8] 获取配置好的地址："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:784
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# dhclient wlan0\n"
msgstr "# dhclient wlan0\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:786
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Using Both Wired and Wireless Connections"
msgstr "同时使用有线和无线连接"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:790
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A wired connection provides better performance and reliability, while a "
"wireless connection provides flexibility and mobility.  Laptop users "
"typically want to roam seamlessly between the two types of connections."
msgstr "有线连接的性能和可靠性更好，而无线连接则更加灵活、便于移动。笔记本电脑用户通常希望在这两种连接之间无缝切换。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:793
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"On FreeBSD, it is possible to combine two or even more network interfaces "
"together in a \"failover\" fashion.  This type of configuration uses the "
"most preferred and available connection from a group of network interfaces, "
"and the operating system switches automatically when the link state changes."
msgstr "在 FreeBSD 上，可以将两个或更多网络接口组合为“故障转移”模式。这种配置会从一组网络接口中使用优先级最高且可用的连接，并在链路状态发生变化时由操作系统自动切换。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:795
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Link aggregation and failover is covered in crossref:advanced-"
"networking[network-aggregation,\"Link Aggregation and Failover\"] and an "
"example for using both wired and wireless connections is provided at "
"crossref:advanced-networking[networking-lagg-wired-and-wireless,\"Failover "
"Mode Between Ethernet and Wireless Interfaces\"]."
msgstr "链路聚合和故障转移的相关内容见 crossref:advanced-networking[network-aggregation,\"Link Aggregation and Failover\"]；有关同时使用有线和无线连接的示例，请参阅 crossref:advanced-networking[networking-lagg-wired-and-wireless,\"Failover Mode Between Ethernet and Wireless Interfaces\"]。"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:797
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Hostname"
msgstr "主机名"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:800
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The hostname represents the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) of the host "
"on the network."
msgstr "主机名表示主机在网络中的完全限定域名（FQDN）。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:804
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If no hostname is set for the host, FreeBSD will call itself `Amnesiac`."
msgstr "如果未为主机设置主机名，FreeBSD 会将其称为 `Amnesiac`。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:807
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Check The Current Hostname"
msgstr "检查当前主机名"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:810
#, fuzzy
msgid "man:hostname[1] can be used to check the current hostname:"
msgstr "可以使用 man:hostname[1] 检查当前主机名："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:814
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "$ hostname\n"
msgstr "$ hostname\n"

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:821
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "freebsdhostname.example.com\n"
msgstr "freebsdhostname.example.com\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:824
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Change Hostname"
msgstr "更改主机名"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:827
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To change the hostname of the host and persist it across reboots execute the "
"following command:"
msgstr "要更改主机名并使其在重启后保持不变，请执行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:831
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc hostname=\"freebsdhostname.example.com\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc hostname=\"freebsdhostname.example.com\"\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:834
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "DNS"
msgstr "DNS"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:837
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The DNS could be understood as a link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Telephone_directory[telephone directory] in which an IP is identified to a "
"hostname and vice versa."
msgstr "DNS 可以理解为 link:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telephone_directory[电话簿]，用于将 IP 地址映射到主机名，反之亦然。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:840
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There are three files that handle how a FreeBSD system interact with the "
"DNS.  These three files are man:hosts[5], man:resolv.conf[5] and man:"
"nsswitch.conf[5]"
msgstr "有三个文件负责处理 FreeBSD 系统与 DNS 的交互，分别是 man:hosts[5]、man:resolv.conf[5] 和 man:nsswitch.conf[5]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:842
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Unless otherwise stated in the [.filename]#/etc/nsswitch.conf# file, FreeBSD "
"will look at the addresses in the [.filename]#/etc/hosts# file and then the "
"DNS information in the [.filename]#/etc/resolv.conf# file."
msgstr "除非 [.filename]#/etc/nsswitch.conf# 文件中另有说明，否则 FreeBSD 会先查找 [.filename]#/etc/hosts# 文件中的地址，然后查找 [.filename]#/etc/resolv.conf# 文件中的 DNS 信息。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:846
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The man:nsswitch.conf[5] file specifies how the nsdispatch (name-service "
"switch dispatcher) should operate."
msgstr "man:nsswitch.conf[5] 文件指定 nsdispatch（名称服务切换分派器）的运行方式。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:848
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"By default, the hosts section of the [.filename]#/etc/nsswitch.conf# file "
"will be as follows:"
msgstr "默认情况下，[.filename]#/etc/nsswitch.conf# 文件中的 hosts 部分如下所示："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:852
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "hosts: files dns\n"
msgstr "hosts: files dns\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:856
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For example, in case of using the man:nscd[8] service.  The order of "
"preference could be changed by leaving the line as follows:"
msgstr "例如，使用 man:nscd[8] 服务时，可以按如下方式更改优先顺序："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:860
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "hosts: files cache dns\n"
msgstr "hosts: files cache dns\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:864
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Local addresses"
msgstr "本地地址"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:869
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The [.filename]#/etc/hosts# file is a simple text database who provide host "
"name to IP address mappings.  Entries for local computers connected via a "
"LAN can be added to this file for simplistic naming purposes instead of "
"setting up a DNS server.  Additionally, [.filename]#/etc/hosts# can be used "
"to provide a local record of Internet names, reducing the need to query "
"external DNS servers for commonly accessed names."
msgstr "[.filename]#/etc/hosts# 文件是一个简单的文本数据库，用于将主机名映射到 IP 地址。可以将通过 LAN 连接的本地计算机条目添加到此文件，以便简单地命名，而无需设置 DNS 服务器。此外，[.filename]#/etc/hosts# 还可用于记录本地的 Internet 名称，从而减少对常用名称查询外部 DNS 服务器的需求。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:871
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For example, in the case of having a local instance of package:www/gitlab-"
"ce[] in a local environment, it could be added as follows to the file [."
"filename]#/etc/hosts#:"
msgstr "例如，在本地环境中运行 package:www/gitlab-ce[] 实例时，可以将以下内容添加到 [.filename]#/etc/hosts# 文件中："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:875
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "192.168.1.150 git.example.com git\n"
msgstr "192.168.1.150 git.example.com git\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:878
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Configuring the Nameserver"
msgstr "配置名称服务器"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:881
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"How a FreeBSD system accesses the Internet Domain Name System (DNS) is "
"controlled by man:resolv.conf[5]."
msgstr "FreeBSD 系统访问 Internet 域名系统（DNS）的方式由 man:resolv.conf[5] 控制。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:883
#, fuzzy
msgid "The most common entries to [.filename]#/etc/resolv.conf# are:"
msgstr "[.filename]#/etc/resolv.conf# 中最常见的条目如下："

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:889
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`nameserver`"
msgstr "`nameserver`"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:891
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "The IP address of a name server the resolver should query. The servers are queried in the order listed with a maximum of three."
msgstr "解析器应查询的名称服务器 IP 地址。服务器按列出的顺序进行查询，最多可列出三个。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:892
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`search`"
msgstr "`search`"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:894
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Search list for hostname lookup. This is normally determined by the domain of the local hostname."
msgstr "用于查找主机名的搜索列表。通常由本地主机名的域名决定。"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:895
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "`domain`"
msgstr "`domain`"

#. type: Table
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:896
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "The local domain name."
msgstr "本地域名。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:899
#, fuzzy
msgid "A typical [.filename]#/etc/resolv.conf# looks like this:"
msgstr "典型的 [.filename]#/etc/resolv.conf# 文件如下所示："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:905
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"search example.com\n"
"nameserver 147.11.1.11\n"
"nameserver 147.11.100.30\n"
msgstr "search example.com\nnameserver 147.11.1.11\nnameserver 147.11.100.30\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:910
#, fuzzy
msgid "Only one of the `search` and `domain` options should be used."
msgstr "`search` 和 `domain` 选项只能使用其中一个。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:913
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When using DHCP, man:dhclient[8] usually rewrites [.filename]#/etc/resolv."
"conf# with information received from the DHCP server."
msgstr "使用 DHCP 时，man:dhclient[8] 通常会根据从 DHCP 服务器接收到的信息重写 [.filename]#/etc/resolv.conf#。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:917
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the machine in which the configuration is being made is *not* a DNS "
"server, man:local-unbound[8] can be used to improve DNS lookup performance."
msgstr "如果配置的计算机*不是* DNS 服务器，可以使用 man:local-unbound[8] 提高 DNS 查询性能。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:919
#, fuzzy
msgid "To enable it at boot time execute the following command:"
msgstr "要在启动时启用它，请执行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:923
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc local_unbound_enable=\"YES\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc local_unbound_enable=\"YES\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:926
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To start the man:local-unbound[8] service execute the following command:"
msgstr "要启动 man:local-unbound[8] 服务，请执行以下命令："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:930
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# service local_unbound start\n"
msgstr "# service local_unbound start\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:934
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:937
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When troubleshooting hardware and software configurations, check the simple "
"things first."
msgstr "排查硬件和软件配置问题时，请先检查最简单的事项。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:939
#, fuzzy
msgid "Is the network cable plugged in?"
msgstr "网络电缆是否已插好？"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:940
#, fuzzy
msgid "Are the network services properly configured?"
msgstr "网络服务是否已正确配置？"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:941
#, fuzzy
msgid "Is the firewall configured correctly?"
msgstr "防火墙是否配置正确？"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:942
#, fuzzy
msgid "Is the NIC supported by FreeBSD?"
msgstr "FreeBSD 是否支持该网卡？"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:943
#, fuzzy
msgid "Is the router working correctly?"
msgstr "路由器是否正常工作？"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:947
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Before sending a bug report, always check the Hardware Notes in the link:"
"https://www.freebsd.org/releases/[FreeBSD release page], update the version "
"of FreeBSD to the latest STABLE version, check the mailing list archives, "
"and search the Internet."
msgstr "提交错误报告前，务必查看 link:https://www.freebsd.org/releases/[FreeBSD 发布页面]中的硬件说明，将 FreeBSD 更新到最新的 STABLE 版本，查阅邮件列表存档，并搜索互联网。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:950
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Troubleshooting in Wired Networks"
msgstr "有线网络故障排除"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:954
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the card works, yet performance is poor, read through man:tuning[7].  "
"Also, check the network configuration as incorrect network settings can "
"cause slow connections."
msgstr "如果网卡可以正常工作，但性能不佳，请阅读 man:tuning[7]。此外，还要检查网络配置，因为不正确的网络设置可能导致连接速度变慢。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:959
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`No route to host` messages occur if the system is unable to route a packet "
"to the destination host.  This can happen if no default route is specified "
"or if a cable is unplugged.  Check the output of `netstat -rn` and make sure "
"there is a valid route to the host.  If there is not, read crossref:advanced-"
"networking[network-routing,\"Gateways and Routes\"]."
msgstr "如果系统无法将数据包路由到目标主机，就会出现 `No route to host` 消息。这可能是因为未指定默认路由，或者网线未插好。检查 `netstat -rn` 的输出，并确认存在一条到该主机的有效路由。如果没有，请阅读 crossref:advanced-networking[network-routing,\"网关和路由\"]。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:963
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"`ping: sendto: Permission denied` error messages are often caused by a "
"misconfigured firewall.  If a firewall is enabled on FreeBSD but no rules "
"have been defined, the default policy is to deny all traffic, even man:"
"ping[8].  Refer to crossref:firewalls[firewalls,Firewalls] for more "
"information."
msgstr "`ping: sendto: Permission denied` 错误消息通常是由防火墙配置错误造成的。如果 FreeBSD 上启用了防火墙，但没有定义任何规则，默认策略会拒绝所有流量，甚至包括 man:ping[8]。有关详细信息，请参阅 crossref:firewalls[firewalls,防火墙]。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:965
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Troubleshooting in Wireless Networks"
msgstr "无线网络故障排除"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:968
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This section describes a number of steps to help troubleshoot common "
"wireless networking problems."
msgstr "本节介绍了若干步骤，可用于排查常见的无线网络问题。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:970
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the access point is not listed when scanning, check that the "
"configuration has not limited the wireless device to a limited set of "
"channels."
msgstr "如果扫描时未列出接入点，请检查配置是否将无线设备限制在有限的信道集合内。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:972
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If the device cannot associate with an access point, verify that the "
"configuration matches the settings on the access point. This includes the "
"authentication scheme and any security protocols. Simplify the configuration "
"as much as possible. If using a security protocol such as WPA2 or WPA, "
"configure the access point for open authentication and no security to see if "
"traffic will pass."
msgstr "如果设备无法与接入点关联，请确认配置与接入点上的设置一致。这包括认证方案和任何安全协议。尽可能简化配置。如果使用 WPA2 或 WPA 等安全协议，请将接入点配置为开放式认证且不启用安全措施，以检查流量是否能够通过。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:974
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Once the system can associate with the access point, diagnose the network "
"configuration using tools like man:ping[8]."
msgstr "系统能够与接入点关联后，请使用 man:ping[8] 等工具诊断网络配置。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/network/_index.adoc:975
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There are many lower-level debugging tools. Debugging messages can be "
"enabled in the 802.11 protocol support layer using man:wlandebug[8]."
msgstr "还有许多较低层级的调试工具。可以使用 man:wlandebug[8] 在 802.11 协议支持层启用调试消息。"
